sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant App as Android app
  participant Gems
  participant GDB as Gems DB
  participant CDB as Comments DB

  U->>App: Open the discovery map
  App->>Gems: GET /gem/within?south&west&north&east[&limit]
  Gems->>GDB: Gems inside the map area, highest GemScore first (2dsphere index)
  GDB-->>Gems: Gems
  Gems-->>App: 200 [gems]
  App-->>U: Show a marker per gem
  U->>App: Tap a gem
  App->>Gems: GET /gem?name=places/<place ID>
  alt Name malformed
    Gems-->>App: 400 { message: "Invalid Gem name." }
  else
    Gems->>GDB: Find gem by name
    alt No such gem (e.g. deleted)
      GDB-->>Gems: none
      Gems-->>App: 404 { message: "No such Gem." }
    else Found
      GDB-->>Gems: Gem
      Gems-->>App: 200 gem (name, place, type, description, GemScore, ratings)
      App->>Gems: GET /gem/:pk/comments
      Gems->>CDB: Comments of this gem, oldest first
      CDB-->>Gems: Comments
      Gems-->>App: 200 [{ id, body, author, authorName }]
      App-->>U: Show the gem's details, GemScore and comments
    end
  end
